/E (The DRQN is a DQN with recurrent layers, useful for Partially Observable Markov Decision Processes \(POMDPs\) where only limited information is available about the environment. Retaining information about past states helps the agent understand the environment better and determine the optimal action in POMDP scenarios.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
