256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We input the game screen into the convolutional layer. This layer convolves the image to create a feature map, which is then forwarded to the LSTM layer. The LSTM layer possesses memory to retain crucial details, preserving significant past game states and adjusting its memory as needed during time steps. Subsequently, the hidden state from the LSTM layer is fed into the fully connected layer, which generates the Q value.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
